  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "5.0.0: Properties, nullable types, dictionaries and many more member types; custom converters; ParseArguments with structured errors; all ArgumentTypes flags and the default argument implemented; validation attributes and IValidatableArguments; verbs (VerbParser); response files; environment variable fallback; exclusive groups; aliases; hidden and categorized help, usage line, description; completion scripts for bash, zsh and PowerShell; message formatter; trim and AOT annotations. See README for breaking changes.",
